  unitName: Edea
  unitId: 30162
  unitNumber: 245
  description: "One of the four legendary warriors who fought to save the Kingdom
    of Palmyna. Clad from head to toe in armor which concealed her true identity,
    legend has it that this knight was actually the Princess of Palmyna in disguise.
    After hearing about the gods\u2019 plans to lay waste to Palmyna, Edea clad herself
    in the legendary Emerald Armor of Lafdonia, and set out on a mission to save
    her homeland."
  summonDesc: Will you join me and fight<br>against the gods?<br>In that case, raise
    your sword!
  fusionDesc: "W-Wow! I can feel the power<br>surging through me!<br>Hey, don\u2019t
    peek inside my armor!"
